      "widgets_values": [
        "Hyperrealistic macro photograph of a team of tiny watchmakers—each precisely 2 inches tall—meticulously assembling an antique pocket watch mechanism. One craftsman carefully positions a ruby bearing with tweezers, another oils a brass gear with a microscopic dropper, and a third inspects a hairspring through a magnifying loupe. The scene features dramatic 3-point lighting: a key light highlighting the golden gears, a soft fill illuminating the workers' concentrated faces, and a rim light creating Fresnel reflections along the polished metal edges. Floating metallic dust particles and tiny oil droplets suspended in air catch volumetric light rays streaming from overhead. Ultra-detailed textures: worn leather aprons, tarnished brass components, scratched wood workbench, and delicate watch springs. Shallow depth of field with sharp focus on the central worker, smooth bokeh blurring the background tools. 8K resolution, photorealistic materials, warm amber and cool blue color grading, cinematic vignette framing the scene.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
